{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"OSS consensus audit (2026-08-13): APPROVED pattern, already merged as 012854fb86.\n\nPylint constructs an immutable Astroid Project once in a module-scoped fixture and reuses it across diagram-analysis tests (pylint-dev/pylint@03eaf44, tests/pyreverse/test_diadefs.py#L59-L68). Astroid uses session fixtures for stable source corpora in its end-to-end benchmarks (pylint-dev/astroid@04ba439, tests/benchmarks/test_bench_endtoend.py#L103-L114).\n\nThe merged session fixture plus per-path parse memoization is the same lifecycle: immutable analysis state is shared only inside one pytest process/session, while every guard and defect-seeded assertion remains. Tracker cross-check found no rejection or competing ownership."},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1786638501427978001,"uuid":"bcf36f89-326a-4485-a257-68c84e8c2153"}